// =============================================================================
// 06: LIVE DJ SET — REAL DJ ARRANGEMENT (FADE-INS, ATMOSPHERE & DROPS)
// =============================================================================
//
// 🎧 THE REAL DJ EXPERIENCE:
//   No aggressive drums at the start! Each track begins with pure atmosphere:
//   lush floating chords with an automatic DJ low-pass filter sweep (.lpf(sine...))
//   that breathes in and out like a DJ working the mixer knob.
//
// 🎛️ CONTROLS:
//   <leader>ml : :StrudelLaunch (Connect to Strudel engine)
//   <leader>mp : :StrudelToggle (Play / Pause audio)
//   <leader>mu : :StrudelUpdate (UPDATE CHANGES LIVE — Press after each move!)
//
// 🎹 REAL DJ TRANSITION TECHNIQUE:
//   1. BUILDUP : Press gcc on layers to bring in melody, bass, and hats.
//   2. THE DROP: Press gcc on the Kick line -> <leader>mu (the anchor beat drops!).
//   3. BREAKDOWN: Before switching songs, press gcc on the Kick line -> <leader>mu
//                 (cuts the beat out, leaving only floating ambient chords!).
//   4. TRANSITION: vip then d to delete the track, vip then gc to uncomment the next
//                 track, then <leader>mu -> enters smoothly with next track's chords!
// =============================================================================


// =============================================================================
// 🌙 TRACK 1: "DEEP SUNRISE" (Atmospheric Ambient -> Dub Drop — 100 CPM)
// =============================================================================
// Starts with ZERO drums. Just lush chords with a slow DJ filter sweep.
// Press <leader>mp to begin. Uncomment layers one by one, then drop the beat!

stack(
  // 1. [INTRO / ATMOSPHERE] Floating ambient pad with slow DJ filter sweep (ACTIVE)
  note("<[c3,g3] [eb3,bb3] [f3,c4] [g3,d4]>")
    .s("triangle")
    .lpf(sine.range(350, 1600).slow(16))
    .room(0.85)
    .delay(0.4)
    .slow(4)
    .gain(0.4),

  // 2. [MELODY] Soft sine pluck (Press gcc here)
  // note("c3 ~ [~ eb3] ~ g3 ~").s("sine").room(0.6).delay(0.3).gain(0.35),

  // 3. [BASS] Deep warm sub-bass pulse (Press gcc here)
  // note("c2 ~ eb2 ~").s("sawtooth").lpf(380).gain(0.55),

  // 4. [PERCUSSION] Spacey ghost rim & offbeat hat (Press gcc here)
  // s("~ hh ~ rim").room(0.4).gain(0.3),

  // 5. [THE DROP] Gentle anchor kick — drop this last! (Press gcc here)
  // s("bd ~ bd ~").lpf(700).gain(0.6),
).cpm(100)


// =============================================================================
// 🌇 TRACK 2: "VELVET GROOVE" (Warm Floating House — 108 CPM)
// =============================================================================
// DJ TRANSITION MOVE:
//   1. In Track 1: Mute the kick (gcc on line 50 -> <leader>mu) for a breakdown.
//   2. Delete Track 1: Move cursor inside, press: vip then d
//   3. Start Track 2: Move cursor below, press: vip then gc
//   4. Press <leader>mu -> Track 2 fades in with warm chords and ZERO drums!
// =============================================================================

